essive linework. Mix of detailed semi-realistic anime (main poses), chibi/SD (small ones), rough sketch (gesture drawings). Pencil + ink + selective color. ===== FACE ACCURACY ===== Every drawing must clearly be the SAME PERSON from Image 2. Face shape, eyes, nose, mouth, hairstyle, hair color consistent and recognizable across all drawings. ===== OUTPUT ===== One single sketchbook page, white background, filled edge-to-edge with overlapping drawings. Pure creative chaos."
